cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Bu yazılımı kullanırsanız lütfen aşağıdaki künyeyle atıf yapın. If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Doktor MCP"
abstract: >-
  Source-grounded legal information MCP server for physicians. It matches
  questions on patient rights, informed consent and personal health data only
  with official Turkish legislation text and reasoned high court decisions.
  It does not give categorical final legal opinions; when an official source
  cannot be retrieved or a provision cannot be extracted, it returns a
  structured "unavailable" result instead of producing content.
